Read and follow [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md). Do not copy these rules into another file.

The short version:

- Reply in English.
- BAWT is a stack, not a sample site.
- Business content lives in Wix. Do not invent items, prices, testimonials, or posts.
- Check whether a skill covers the task in [skills/INVENTORY.md](mdc:skills/INVENTORY.md) and read it first.
- Finish with `npm run verify` green. If a check fails, fix the cause.
